  "description": "Important: Please Read Before Registering<br/>To enquire about this property or attend a home open, you must register your interest via the \"Get in touch\" button on the listing.<br/><br/>Registering through Snug ensures you receive all updates, including inspection times, cancellations, time changes and any important information relating to the property.<br/>Simply adding the home open to your plan or calendar does not register your attendance and you may miss important updates.<br/><br/>Please note that you must inspect the property before applying. Snug applications will only be accepted once you have viewed the property.<br/><br/>** VIEWINGS**<br/>Please arrive on time for your inspection. For properties within secure complexes, our Leasing Consultant cannot leave the home open to provide building access once the inspection has commenced so it is recommended that you arrive prior to the start time. Late arrivals may be unable to access the property and could miss the opportunity to inspect.<br/><br/>Contemporary Coastal Living<br/><br/>Experience effortless beachside living at 262 Shorehaven Boulevard, Alkimos. Set amongst beautifully presented homes and moments from the coast, this contemporary residence offers a relaxed, low-maintenance lifestyle in a family-friendly neighbourhood. With parklands, sandy beaches and everyday conveniences close by, the home is ideally suited to those seeking modern living with the best of Alkimos at their doorstep.<br/><br/>Features:<br/>- Separate open theatre room<br/>- Three bedrooms with robes<br/>- Two bathrooms<br/>- Master bedroom with ensuite including vanity, shower and toilet<br/>- Main bathroom with separate shower and bath<br/>- Stylish kitchen with large gas cooktop and oven, stone benchtops and dishwasher<br/>- Sit-up breakfast bar<br/>- Open-plan living area with direct access to the alfresco<br/>- Sleek wood-look flooring throughout<br/>- Ducted reverse-cycle air conditioning<br/>- Low-maintenance backyard with paving and artificial turf<br/>- Rear double lock-up garage providing secure parking<br/><br/>A little about the location:<br/>- Enjoy the coastal lifestyle with sandy beaches and manicured parklands within walking distance<br/>- Positioned in the popular Shorehaven community with plenty of outdoor spaces to enjoy<br/>- Convenient access to local shopping, schools and everyday amenities<br/>- Easy access to the Mitchell Freeway for commuting throughout Perth<br/>- Public transport options nearby, including Butler Train Station and local bus routes<br/><br/>Available: 9th October <br/>Lease term: 12 Months <br/><br/>Please include a cover letter in your application.<br/><br/>Life is Better with Xceed!",
